0:00.000Z\", \"platform\": \"youtube\", \"type\": \"video\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql:0002","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"title_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"屯門南延綫升級重置社區泳池 Upgrading & Re-provisioning Community Swimming Pool under the Tuen Mun South Extension","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql:0003","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"description_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"【鐵路鑽深啲👷🏻‍♂️屯門南延綫升級重置社區泳池 🏊🏻‍♂️】起鐵路同時起埋泳池？為咗騰出空間興建未來屯門南延綫嘅第 16 區站，我哋將原有屯門游泳池升級重置咗喺輕鐵車廠站附近嘅屯門康樂體育中心。 呢個工程用咗 BIM 🤖去優化規劃，加快成個建造過程～依家重置工程已經完成喇！新泳池設施更新完仲更加完善，進一步提升咗屯門社區嘅生活質素。一齊去片重温一吓呢項建造工程啦！而原有泳池嘅拆卸工程亦已經展開，完成後就會全力建設新站🚉 #屯門南延綫 #第 16 區站 #屯門泳池 #升級重置社區設施 [Railway 101👷🏻‍♂️Upgrading & Re-provisioning Community Swimming Pool under the Tuen Mun South Extension🏊🏻‍♂️] Building a railway and a swimming pool at the same time? To make way for the construction of the future A16 Station of the Tuen Mun South Extension, MTR has upgraded and re-provisioned the Tuen Mun Swimming Pool (TMSP) at the Tuen Mun Recreation and Sports Centre beside the Tuen Mun Depot Light Rail Stop. Featuring new facilities, the TMSP will enhance the living standards of the Tuen Mun community! To optimise planning and speed up the construction process, BIM 🤖has been applied to this project, check out the video to see how the project came together! Demolition of the original pool is now in progress to make way for the construction of the new A16 Station. Once completed, the construction of the new station will be in full swing.🚉 #TuenMunSouthExtension #A16Station #TuenMunSwimmingPool #Upgrade&Re-provisionOfCommunityFacilities","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql:0004","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"author_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"displayName\": \"MTR Hong Kong\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql:0006","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"media_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"createdAt\": \"2026-02-19T00:00:00.000Z\", \"duration\": 36, \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WZTOLwgO93c/maxresdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAKENAF8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGFogZShLMA8=&rs=AOn4CLDms429dGf6YKBrxkUBnOGargbV9A\", \"type\": \"video\"}","text_contains_http":"1.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql:0007","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3gihtq000fbn5kvgwjfaql","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"thumbnail_reference","evid